Combine the reports of the parts of one catalog into the report the whole would have written

Usage: njutest merge [OPTIONS] <REPORT>...

Arguments:
  <REPORT>...  The reports to combine, one per part

Options:
      --output <FILE>    Write the combined report here rather than to standard output
      --rerun            Run every sealed execution the whole rests on again on this machine, and
                         write it only where each comes to what its part recorded
      --directory <DIR>  The workspace the parts measured, which `--rerun` runs the executions in.
                         The working directory by default
      --offline          Pass --offline to every cargo command `--rerun` starts
      --locked           Pass --locked to every cargo command `--rerun` starts
  -h, --help             Print help
